<title>SWITZERLAND: Gas Vision net profit tumbles in 1996.</title>
<headline>Gas Vision net profit tumbles in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WILEN, Switzerland 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p> (million Swiss francs)		   1996	  1995</p>
<p> Net profit				    3.7	  64.4</p>
<p> Administration expenses		  62.1	  10.8</p>
<p> Financial expenses			  2.5	   3.5</p>
<p> Depreciation of incorporation costs   3.8	   3.0</p>
<p> Taxes					   5.2	   3.4</p>
<p> Total assets				818.4	 595.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Gas Vision AG is an investment company chaired by Martin Ebner. Administration expenses reflect compensation for performance in the previous year.</p>
<p>-- Zurich +41 1 631 7340</p>
